<title>FRANCE: HORSE RACING-PRIX DE L'ARC DE TRIOMPHE RUNNERS AND DRAW.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-PRIX DE L'ARC DE TRIOMPHE RUNNERS AND DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>There were 16 final declared runners</p>
<p>on Friday for Sunday's Prix de l' Arc de Triomphe, a group one</p>
<p>race run over 12 furlongs (2.4 km) for three-year-olds and</p>
<p>upwards; value to winner 527,000 pounds ($825,000): </p>
<p>Tabulate under form, horse, owner, trainer, jockey, draw.</p>
<p>(Middle numbers have slight advantage)</p>
<p>13-3121 SWAIN (Sheikh Mohammed) (A.Fabre) T.Jarnet (13)</p>
<p>112144 TAMURE (Sheikh Mohammed) (J.Gosden in England) F.Head</p>
<p>(14)</p>
<p>251-112 CLASSIC CLICHE (Godolphin) (S.bin Suroor in England)</p>
<p>F.Dettori (12)</p>
<p>3-21141 OSCAR SCHINDLER (O.Lehane) (K.Prendergast in Ireland)</p>
<p>C.Asmussen (11) 3-21811 PILSUDSKI (Lord Weinstock) (M.Stoute in</p>
<p>England) W.Swinburn (10)</p>
<p>421253 LEEDS (R.Soula) (H.Van de Poele) O.Doleuze (8) 11-4312</p>
<p>PENTIRE (T.Yoshida) (G.Wragg in England) M.Hills (7) 41-134</p>
<p>SHAAMIT (Khalifa Dasmal) (W.Haggas in England) Pat Eddery (6)</p>
<p>3-31913 RADEVORE (K.Abdullah) (A.Fabre) S.Guillot (2) 24112</p>
<p>DARAZARI (Aga Khan) (A.de Royer-Dupre) G.Mosse (16) 3-39229</p>
<p>POLARIS FLIGHT (M.Bin Abdullah) (P.Chapple-Hyam in England) J.</p>
<p>Reid (15)</p>
<p>343658 LE DESTIN (M.Debeusscher) (P Demercastel) D.Boeuf (1)</p>
<p>121 ZAGREB (A Paulson) (D.Weld in Ireland) M.Kinane (3)</p>
<p>111511 HELISSIO (E.Sarasola) (E.Lellouche) O.Peslier (5)</p>
<p>11716 LUNA WELLS (J.L.Lagardere and J.Magnier) (A.Fabre)</p>
<p>T.Thulliez (9) 142254 LEONILA (R.Strauss) (R.Collet) G.Guignard</p>
<p>(4) </p>
<p>Latest betting: 5-2 Helissio, 5-1 Zagreb, 11-2 Swain, 6-1</p>
<p>Darazari, 8-1 Pentire and Classic Cliche, 10-1 Shaamit, 14-1</p>
<p>Oscar Schindler and Pilsudski, 20-1 and upwards others.</p>
